rvival\nEngineering Discoveries\nEngineering Discoveries\nBroadband Communications\nGiving People Their Voice\nPlug-In Hybrid Cars\nEnvironmental Discoveries\nEnvironmental Discoveries\nGetting Lead Out of Gasoline\nSaving Lake Tahoe\nMedical Discoveries\nMedical Discoveries\nIdentifying Feline AIDS\nFragile X Syndrome (FXTAS)B\nWhole-Body PET Scan\nBetter HIV Treatment\nAccelerating Cancer-Fighting Drugs\nImaging Unwinding DNA\nThe One Health Model\nSocial Science Discoveries\nSocial Science Discoveries\nBaby Sign Language\nEarly Hunters Were Female\nTransforming Attachment Theory\nVeterinary Science Discoveries\nVeterinary Science Discoveries\nTreating Animal Burns With Tilapia Skins\nCampus Life\nCampus Life\nCalifornia’s College Town\nCalifornia’s College Town\nThe College Tour\nThings To Do\nThings To Do\nTraditions\nTraditions\n#ourUCDavis\nFall Welcome\nHomecoming\nPicnic Day\nArboretum\nArts and Culture\nCalendar\nCalendar\nCampus Poster Calendars\nHousing\nDining\nStudent Jobs\nClubs and Communities\nAthletics\nNews\nNews\nLatest News\nIn Focus Features\nUniversity News\nDateline\nUC Davis Magazine\nSocial Media\nSocial Media\nSocial Media Guidelines\nStudent News\nBlogs\nPodcasts and Shows\nPodcasts and Shows\nFace to Face\nThat May Be the Chancellor\nThursday Thoughts\nUnfold\nThe Backdrop\nUC Davis LIVE\nSearch\nUC Davis\nUC Davis\nDoes your oil live up to its label?\nExplore our oil quality research\nWatch video\nOil buying tips\nShop our olive oil products\nSubscribe\nFind Yourself\nat UC Davis\nUC Davis is one of the most prestigious public universities in the world for a reason. The university and the amazing college town of Davis are designed to help you grow beyond even your own expectations.\nFind your fit\nMajors\nCampus life\nVisit\nApply\nEnter the Aggieverse!\nThere’s always something happening at UC Davis. Step into the Aggieverse to stay up to date on breaking news, campus events and the traditions that make UC Davis unique.\nRead more news\nA Native California Wildflower Isn’t Keeping Up with Climate Change\nStudents Learn Plant Breeding, Gain Career Experience\nBird Flight Research Advances Drone Technology and Wild Raptor Care\nWhat to Know About Processed and Ultra-Processed Food\nFederal Funding Protects California’s Future\nThat Avocado Oil Chip You’re Eating May Not Be Made With Pure Avocado Oil\nIn the middle of everywhere\nUC Davis is centrally located in Northern California, making it easy to explore some of California’s most iconic destinations. From San Francisco and Napa Valley to Lake Tahoe and Yosemite National Park, students can enjoy unforgettable day trips and weekend adventures just a short drive from campus.\nExplore the region\n1\nRanked No. 1 nationally in agriculture and forestry\n2\nRanked No. 2 nationally for social mobility\n1\nRanked No. 1 nationally in veterinary medicine\n2\nRanked No. 2 nationally for graduate financial success\n1\nRanked No. 1 nationally in campus sustainability\n8\nRanked No. 8 nationally among public universities\nA top-ranked public institution\nUC Davis is a tier-one research university. Several of our programs are among the best in the country and have been for decades. We hope you will help us continue this legacy and solve some of the world’s greatest challenges.\nSee all rankings\nA research powerhouse\nUC Davis is a leading research university where undergraduates work alongside MacArthur Fellows and world-renowned faculty. Together, we advance discoveries that solve the world’s most pressing challenges.\nMore research\n1930s\nHardier Strawberries\nAbout this discovery\n2020s\nBrain-Computer Interface\nAbout this discovery\n2000s\nThe Plug-in Hybrid Car\nAbout this discovery\n1960s\nCalifornia's Chardonnay\nAbout this discovery\n1980s\nExtreme Biological Survival\nAbout this discovery\n1970s\nDangers of Leaded Gasoline\nAbout this discovery\n1950s\nHarvester-Ready Tomatoes\nAbout this discovery\nHousing\nAthletics\nFacilities\nClubs and communities\nRecreation\nCalifornia’s college town\nA thriving campus bursting with Aggie pride\nDavis has everything you would expect from a large university and a lot of experiences that will surprise you. Your new home is going to be fun.\nMore campus life\nLoading...\nFollow us\nSchools\nBetty Irene Moore School of Nursing\nContinuing and Professional Education\nGraduate School of Management\nSchool of Education\nSchool of Law\nSchool of Medicine\nSchool of Veterinary Medicine\nColleges\nAgricultural and Environmental Sciences\nBiological Sciences\nEngineering\nLetters and Science\nResearch Centers\nAggie Square\nBodega Marine Laboratory\nComprehensive Cancer Center\nMcClellan Nuclear Research Center\nNational Biomedical Research Institute\nRobert Mondavi Institute for Wine and Food Science\nTahoe Environmental Research Center\nUC Davis Institute of the Environment\nCampus\nCampus Map\nDirections and Parking\nEmergency Services\nHealthcare\nStudent Health and Counseling Services\nUC Davis Health\nVeterinary Medicine\nResources\nAcademic Calendar\nDirectory\nApplication Information\nCourse Schedule\nJobs\nOne Shields Avenue\nDavis, CA 96158\n530-752-1011\nContact Us\nMake a Gift\nUniversity of California, Davis\n, One Shields Avenue, Davis, CA 95616 | 530-752-1011\nQuestions or comments?\nPrivacy & Accessibility\nPrinciples of Community\nUniversity of California\nLast update: September 30, 2026\nCopyright © The Regents of the University of California, Davis campus. All rights reserved.\nThis site is officially grown in\nSiteFarm\n.\nReport Accessibility Issue",
